  "releaseNotes": "Beta 1: v3 targets .NET 8+ only, uses a single async ExecuteAsync<T>(RestRequest, CancellationToken) execution path, adds RestRequest factories, replaces context-dependent Parameters with QueryParameters and explicit Content/PostForm support, removes synchronous Execute<T>, removes sync-over-async response construction, removes the legacy response formatter path, requires content-aware async formatting, copies response headers and content headers, supports absolute URLs, chains request-hook return values, and hardens RestRequest defaults.",
